# Build trees
**/build/
**/build-win/
**/build-cmake/
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/CMakeFiles/
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/Makefile
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.so
**/*.exe
!reference_code/**/*.exe

# Engine + packaged releases (built artifacts)
working_code/gifscythe/release/*/gifsicle
working_code/gifscythe/release/*/gifsicle.exe
working_code/gifscythe/release/*/Gifscythe/
working_code/gifscythe/release/*/Gifscythe-system/

# Auto-fetched reference clones (large; re-fetch as needed)
reference_code/gifsicle-upstream/
reference_code/caesium-source/
reference_code/caesium-bin/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.user

# SkillOpt in-repo integration (docs/planning/SKILLOPT_INTEGRATION_QUERY.md). Everything
# generated under tools/skillopt/ is disposable, large (a venv is ~173 MB), and must never
# reach the tracked tree: a stray path there would trip the dirty-tree gate (check_docs.sh
# G18 / pr_preflight P3) for every later session.
/tools/skillopt/.venv/
/tools/skillopt/wheelhouse/
/tools/skillopt/state/
/tools/skillopt/runs/
/tools/skillopt/outputs/
/tools/skillopt/.skillopt/
